# Vercel
.vercel

# onnxruntime-web runtime for the SAM racket segmenter. Self-hosted (never CDN)
# but NOT committed — ~50MB that already ships inside node_modules and is staged
# into place by scripts/copy-ort-wasm.mjs on predev/prebuild. The model weights
# under public/models/sam2 ARE committed; only this runtime is regenerated.
/public/ort/

# @ffmpeg/ffmpeg's ESM worker, staged by scripts/copy-ffmpeg-worker.mjs. It must
# be served as a STATIC file rather than bundled: webpack compiles the dynamic
# import inside it into its own module registry, which cannot resolve the runtime
# core URL ("Cannot find module 'blob:…'"). Not committed, for the same reason as
# public/ort — it ships in node_modules and must not rot out of step with it.
/public/ffmpeg/

# TypeScript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
.next-verify
# Per-port dev build dirs (NEXT_DIST_DIR). Concurrent `next dev` processes must
# NOT share one distDir — they overwrite each other's chunks and the client then
# 404s on a chunk it was told to load, which surfaces as the full-screen Next
# error overlay.
.next-*
.dev-*.log
